    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/51fbbc58b87aac075591c149c7f694d1.poster.avif?t=1755700670\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/51fbbc58b87aac075591c149c7f694d1.webm?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/51fbbc58b87aac075591c149c7f694d1.mp4?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering materials</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from plants, rocks, and more in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even collect old cloth and cherries to make pink cloth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, rare materials can be hard to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/45cfed5ad76e60d44f1de304db4f2e7c.poster.avif?t=1755700670\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/45cfed5ad76e60d44f1de304db4f2e7c.webm?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/45cfed5ad76e60d44f1de304db4f2e7c.mp4?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate the house</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your cute little puppet friend's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize it with a variety of homemade furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a bunny cafe and a chick campground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/b56c6a8dade236da978ae6503a8f053b.poster.avif?t=1755700670\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/b56c6a8dade236da978ae6503a8f053b.webm?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/b56c6a8dade236da978ae6503a8f053b.mp4?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome obstacles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different areas, each with their own unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And face the obstacles you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard work pays off!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/51fbbc58b87aac075591c149c7f694d1.poster.avif?t=1755700670\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/51fbbc58b87aac075591c149c7f694d1.webm?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/51fbbc58b87aac075591c149c7f694d1.mp4?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering materials</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from plants, rocks, and more in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even collect old cloth and cherries to make pink cloth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, rare materials can be hard to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/45cfed5ad76e60d44f1de304db4f2e7c.poster.avif?t=1755700670\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/45cfed5ad76e60d44f1de304db4f2e7c.webm?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/45cfed5ad76e60d44f1de304db4f2e7c.mp4?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate the house</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your cute little puppet friend's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize it with a variety of homemade furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a bunny cafe and a chick campground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/b56c6a8dade236da978ae6503a8f053b.poster.avif?t=1755700670\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/b56c6a8dade236da978ae6503a8f053b.webm?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/b56c6a8dade236da978ae6503a8f053b.mp4?t=1755700670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome obstacles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different areas, each with their own unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And face the obstacles you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard work pays off!</p>",
